ll 3,142 counties\n• A proper Albers USA projection with Alaska and Hawaii insets, so the whole country fits beautifully in one view\n\nStyle it your way\n• Multiple color palettes\n• Quantile, equal-interval, and continuous color scales\n• Automatic, readable legends\n\nExplore interactively\n• Pinch to zoom and pan smoothly\n• Tap a region to see its value\n\nExport in the format you need\n• SVG for crisp, infinitely scalable vector graphics\n• PDF for documents and printing\n• PNG for slides and sharing\n• CSV to export the joined data itself\n\nMap Data is built entirely in native SwiftUI for iPhone and iPad, with fast, off-thread geometry processing and no third-party tracking. Your API keys are stored securely in the device Keychain and used only for the AI queries you request.\n\nPerfect for journalists, researchers, students, analysts, and anyone who needs to see their data on a map.\n\nDownload Map Data and make your first map today.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackCensoredName": "Map Data", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "18719744", "formattedPrice": "￦3,300", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/map-data/id6786772528?uo=4", "trackContentRating": "4+", "sellerUrl": "https://kizainternet.com/mapdata/", "averageUserRating": 0, "minimumOsVersion": "26.5", "userRatingCount": 0}]}